00:45:25.590 --> 00:45:28.050
And for that reason we
recently added the provisioning

00:45:28.050 --> 00:45:31.770
capability into TerraForm,
which is a popular multi-cloud

00:45:31.770 --> 00:45:33.450
config management system.

